  The reel_script says the Amaravathi dam water level and inflow figures are as of 'நேற்று காலை 6 மணி' in the article, but the draft's reel_script says 'அணைக்கு நீர்வரத்து 98 கன அடியாக உள்ளது' (present tense) versus the article's 'நேற்று... இருந்தது' for the level; the inflow figure is stated as current rather than as of yesterday morning, a changed time reference.
  The reel_script omits the article's note that the Amaravathi river gets water only in monsoon floods (partially covered) — more importantly, the reel_script drops the fact that the river's water comes only in monsoon flood time, leaving the 'ஆண்டு முழுவதும் தண்ணீர் வருவதில்லை' point stated but the flood-passing-over-check-dam explanation is kept; no missing arrest/result apply here.
  The slides_spec line 'கரூர், திருப்பூர் மக்களின் விவசாய, குடிநீர்' is ungrammatical and lacks a clear meaning in Tamil (missing verb/complete phrase).
  The slides_spec line 'மஞ்சம்பட்டி பள்ளத்தாக்கில் உற்பத்தியாகி, கரூர்' is an incomplete sentence fragment with no clear meaning, and mixes the origin with the destination without the Thirumukkoodalur confluence fact being stated.
  The slides_spec line 'கரூர் அருகே உள்ள தடுப்பணை இது' is vague and mixes the check-dam location into a generic statement, and the slides_spec omits the article's statement that the check dam gets water only when the river floods over it.
